{{#if .ariaThinkOpen}}{{getvar::ariaThinkClose}} closes on the line after go. The reply starts on the line after that:{{else}}Reasoning ends at go. The reply:{{/if}} header if <header_instructions>; prose{{#if .ariaLedgerLine}}; ledger last{{/if}}. Nothing above go enters the reply.{{#if .ariaThinkOpen}}
